et":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-80"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"去探望加奈的次数已经多到数不清了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-b5","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-b5"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在刻意疏远妹妹的时候，即使是父母强迫我也没去探望过她。而如今心态改变，自己也变得主动去看她了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-10f","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-10f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"而对加奈来说，和作为兄长的我的关系变好，现在可能把全部的信赖都寄托在了我的身上。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-169","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-169"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"而这一切的发端是那一天―――学校里和鹿岛间发生了那件事的那天。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1cb","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1cb"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我因为想尽快忘掉那不快感，变得不想直接回家了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-209","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-209"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这时想到，母亲还在医院里。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-23c","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-23c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"为了看护加奈，母亲一天中绝大多数时间都独自呆在医院。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-283","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-283"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"和加奈间的隔阂也不复存在了，我轻快地朝医院走去。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-31c","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-31c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「啊拉，隆道君」","speaker":"美树"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-354","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-354"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"走向前台途中，因为一周的住院而变得脸熟的美树小姐向我寒暄道。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-3a6","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-3a6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这种探病生活一直持续了很多年，貌似我被美树以「赌上性命保护妹妹的小英雄」的名号向其他新人护士里大大宣传了一把。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-42b","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-42b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"因为这个原因吧，那里的人们无论当时还是现在都对我抱有格外的好意。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-4b4","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-4b4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"５１２号室。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-4ec","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-4ec"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「加奈，我进来了」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-554","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-554"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……哥哥！」","speaker":"加奈"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-58e","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-58e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"打开房门，就看到在床上躺着的加奈的脸立刻闪亮了一下。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-5d2","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-5d2"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「啊拉，隆道也来了啊」","speaker":"母"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-60d","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-60d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"母亲正在加奈的身旁削苹果。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-65b","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-65b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「嗯，我回来了」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-688","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-688"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"带着些许怪异的感觉我回答道。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-6b9","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-6b9"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「是是，欢迎回来」","speaker":"母"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-6f3","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-6f3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"已经很久没有听母亲说欢迎回来了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-729","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-729"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"什么啊，这么简单就可以听到吗。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-75a","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-75a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"回到家我也只是独自一人。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-784","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-784"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"即使想听也听不到的母亲的欢迎回家的话语，现在能这么简单就听到了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-7e6","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-7e6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"好开心。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-806","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-806"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"若鹿岛夕美是瘟神的话，加奈在我看来已宛如天使。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-844","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-844"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"带给我的感受全然两样。所得的安心感绝然不同。望向我的视线也是有着天渊之别。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-890","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-890"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「加奈」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-8ba","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-8ba"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我微笑着向她打着招呼。将我感谢的心情蕴含其中，这些好像也传达给了加奈似的。她的表情更加明朗了，大大的眼睛闪耀着光辉。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-947","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-947"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……哥哥」","speaker":"加奈"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-97b","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-97b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「啊拉，关系变得相当好了嘛」","speaker":"母"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-9b6","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-9b6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……嘛。是妹妹嘛。这不是当然的吗」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-9f1","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-9f1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「真了不起。吃苹果吗？」","speaker":"母"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-a2b","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-a2b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「给加奈吃吧」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-a5b","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev24/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eve